meta {
  name: Create Company
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "folio": "TEST_CO",
    "company_name": "Empresa de Prueba",
    "company_branch": "Hidalgo",
    "logo": "https://example.com/logo.png",
    "location": "Av. Siempre Viva 123",
    "phone_number": "5551234567",
    "rfc": "TCO260101AB1"
  }
}

docs {
  Requeridos: `folio`, `company_name`. `company_branch`, `logo`, `location`, `phone_number`, `rfc` opcionales. `status` opcional (default `active`).

  Errores: `409 COMPANY_FOLIO_EXISTS` si `folio` ya esta en uso. `409 COMPANY_RFC_EXISTS` si `rfc` ya esta en uso.
}
